---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="首页"
  description="OMAR 是一个用于创建强大智能体组织的 TUI 工具。在一个终端内编排深层并行 AI 智能体。"
  lang="zh-CN"
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <h1 class="hero-title">
        一人成团，<br />在一个终端指挥 <span class="hero-accent"
          >数百个智能体</span
        >。
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        <code>omar</code> 是一个用于创建强大智能体组织的 TUI 工具。<br />像管理公司一样管理AI智能体。
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}zh/docs/`} class="btn btn-primary">快速开始</a>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/lsk567/omar"
          class="btn btn-outline"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener">GitHub</a
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Demo -->
  <section class="demo">
    <div class="container">
      <iframe
        src="https://asciinema.org/a/836739/iframe?autoplay=1&loop=1&speed=2&theme=asciinema"
        allowfullscreen
        loading="lazy"
        scrolling="no"
      ></iframe>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features -->
  <section class="features">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">核心特性</h2>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>深层层级</h3>
          <p>智能体管理智能体，就像一家公司。创建任意深度的并行组织。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>异构后端</h3>
          <p>
            让 Claude、Codex、Cursor 和 Opencode
            协同工作。为每个任务选择最合适的模型。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>完全掌控</h3>
          <p>对话和控制任意子智能体。用方向键导航层级，通过弹窗附加。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>灵活生命周期</h3>
          <p>长运行或临时智能体，由你选择。跨会话的持久状态与记忆快照。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>消息与集成</h3>
          <p>将智能体连接到 Slack 频道，无缝打通人类与 AI 的工作流。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>基于 tmux</h3>
          <p>
            支持所有 tmux 命令和快捷键。高度可定制，经过实战检验的会话管理。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Quick Start -->
  <section class="quickstart">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">快速开始</h2>
      <div class="install-methods">
        <div class="install-tabs">
          <button class="install-tab active" data-tab="oneliner"
            >一键安装</button
          >
          <button class="install-tab" data-tab="brew">Homebrew</button>
          <button class="install-tab" data-tab="source">从源码编译</button>
        </div>
        <div class="install-panel active" id="panel-oneliner">
          <pre><code><span class="prompt">$</span> curl -fsSL https://omar.tech/install.sh | sh</code></pre>
          <p class="install-note">
            支持 macOS 和 Linux，默认安装到 <code>/usr/local/bin</code>。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="install-panel" id="panel-brew">
          <pre><code><span class="prompt">$</span> brew install lsk567/omar/omar</code></pre>
          <p class="install-note">自动安装 tmux 依赖。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="install-panel" id="panel-source">
          <pre><code><span class="prompt">$</span> git clone https://github.com/lsk567/omar.git
<span class="prompt">$</span> cd omar && make install</code></pre>
          <p class="install-note">需要 Rust 1.70+ 和 GNU Make。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">1</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>前置条件</h3>
            <p>
              tmux 3.0+ 和至少一个智能体后端：
              <a
                href="https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/agents-and-tools/claude-code/overview"
                >Claude Code</a
              >、
              <a href="https://developers.openai.com/codex/cli">Codex CLI</a>、
              <a href="https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode">Opencode</a> 或
              <a href="https://cursor.com/cli">Cursor CLI</a>。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">2</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>启动</h3>
            <pre><code><span class="prompt">$</span> omar</code></pre>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">3</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>给执行助理下达任务</h3>
            <p>将提示词粘贴到执行助理窗口，观察智能体自动创建。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* Hero */
  .hero {
    padding: 5rem 0 4rem;
  }

  .hero-inner {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-tag {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: 2.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--text-bright);
  }

  .hero-accent {
    color: #dc143c;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    max-width: 560px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .hero-subtitle code {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .hero-install {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero-install pre {
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .prompt {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    user-select: none;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  /* Demo */
  .demo {
    padding: 0 0 4rem;
  }

  .demo iframe {
    width: 100%;
    height: 600px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Features */
  .features {
    padding: 4rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-bright);
  }

  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .feature-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    transition: border-color 0.15s;
  }

  .feature-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-hover);
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text-bright);
  }

  .feature-card p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Quick Start */
  .quickstart {
    padding: 4rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .quickstart .container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .install-methods {
    max-width: 600px;
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .install-tabs {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .install-tab {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
    font-family: inherit;
    transition:
      color 0.15s,
      border-color 0.15s;
  }

  .install-tab:hover {
    color: var(--text-bright);
  }

  .install-tab.active {
    color: var(--text-bright);
    border-bottom-color: var(--text-bright);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .install-panel {
    display: none;
  }

  .install-panel.active {
    display: block;
  }

  .install-note {
    font-size: 0.825rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }

  .steps {
    max-width: 600px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }

  .step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .step-num {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-weight: 600;
    border-radius: 50%;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .step-content {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .step-content h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--text-bright);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .step-content p {
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .step-content pre {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .demo iframe {
      height: 350px;
    }

    .features-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .step {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll(".install-tab").forEach((tab) => {
    tab.addEventListener("click", () => {
      document
        .querySelectorAll(".install-tab")
        .forEach((t) => t.classList.remove("active"));
      document
        .querySelectorAll(".install-panel")
        .forEach((p) => p.classList.remove("active"));
      tab.classList.add("active");
      document
        .getElementById(`panel-${tab.dataset.tab}`)
        ?.classList.add("active");
    });
  });
</script>
